                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> II</p>
                <p>As a manifestation of the cooperative spirit which underlies the common war
                    effort of China and the United States, appropriate officials of the two
                    Governments will confer from time to time regarding <pb facs="0495" n="485"
                        xml:id="pg485"/> technical problems which may arise in connection with the
                    financial aid herein provided and will exchange information and suggestions
                    regarding ways and means of most effectively applying these funds toward
                    achieving the purposes which are envisaged by the two nations.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
